                                                "text": "Near-synonym: clergy"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99342818-e6bb-455b-88bb-34e943959e5d",
                                                "sense_id": "4b34c29f-07a4-38ac-9efe-d0edd503a242",
                                                "text": "The priesthood sold the land when it became apparent that its donor had no intention of redeeming it."
